    "notes": "Stochastic %K is expressed as the 10-bar close position and %D as its SMA(190), both documented, with an explicit non-zero range guard; the mirrored cross supplies a long exit. Labouchere lot sequencing, the work-time window, and the 40/50 price-step stop and target are not percent fields."
